OL,3,GNEWSASycamore Gap trees among those
OL,4,Aforming new woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive trees grown from seeds from the
OL,7,Fillegally felled sycamore at Hadrian's
OL,8,FWall will be planted during the
OL,9,Fsessions as part of the Trees of Hope
OL,10,Fproject.
